At Devoteam, we believe that technology with strong human values can actively drive change for the better. Discover how Tech for People unlocks the future, creating a positive impact on the people and the world around us. We are a global leading player in Digital Transformation for leading organisations across EMEA, with a revenue of €1B. We believe in transforming technology to create value for our clients, partners and employees in a world where technology is developed for people. We are proud of the culture we have built together. We are proud of our people at the service of technology. We are proud of our diverse environment. Because we are #TechforPeople. Join our multidisciplinary team of Cloud experts, Designers, Business consultants, Security experts, Engineers, Developers and other extraordinary talents, spread across more than 20 EMEA countries. Become one of our +10.000 tech and business leaders on cloud, data and cyber security. Let’s fuse creativity with technology together and build innovative solutions that actively change things for the better.

Job Description

Design, build, and maintain efficient, reusable, and reliable code;
Participate in code reviews and ensure that the coding is done according to best practices;
Provide recommendations for continuous improvement;
Guide and support junior developers, promoting good programming practices and helping in the development of their technical and professional skills;
Create scalable architectures and robust solutions, considering performance and scalability for long-term system needs aligned with business requirements;
Work closely with product teams, designers, business analysts, and other stakeholders to understand system requirements and develop efficient solutions;
Write unit tests and ensure the code is adequately tested, focusing on test coverage and maintaining code quality over time;
Diagnose and resolve complex performance, scalability, and bug issues in the system, working to ensure the stability and reliability of the application;
Focus on code optimization and performance tuning, using advanced profiling and code analysis techniques to ensure applications are fast and efficient;

Qualifications

Bachelor’s degree in the IT area or equivalent;
Strong background in object-oriented development techniques;
Previous working experience in software development with C#, .NETCore, Azure DevOps;
Solid experience with SQL Server;
Cloud Services (plus);
Fluency in English (written and spoken);
French (plus);

Additional Information

